          "htmlContent": "",
          "markdownContent": "### Service Health (RED)\n\nRate / Errors / Duration across all eight services, from the `http_requests_total` and `http_request_duration_seconds` families mirrored to OpenTelemetry instruments by **SPEC-065 R-2** (ADR-0014). Series break down by the OTel `service_name` resource label.\n\n**Requires `OTEL_ENABLED=true`** (the push surface). The always-on Prometheus `/metrics` pull surface stays the source of truth; these panels render the OTLP push mirror. Percentiles use `histogram_quantile` over the `http_request_duration_seconds_bucket` stream. Live query semantics are confirmed by the **SPEC-065 R-4** gated live-check."
        },
